# ── FormalSwarm — what must never be published ──────────────────────────────
#
# Everything the plugin SHIPS is committed: core/, lib/, prompts/, skills/,
# commands/, tests/, the manifests and the docs. What follows is local state,
# noise, or material that is deliberately not part of the published project.

# Generated per machine by `formalswarm init`, and by every debate that runs:
# the detected profile and the scratch directory with its artefacts.
.formalswarm/

# A historical, repository-specific debate that predates this plugin. It stays on
# your disk and is left untouched; it is not published because it references a
# private checkout. Delete this entry to publish it too.
agents/

# Packaging and dependencies (the plugin itself has none)
node_modules/
*.tgz
npm-debug.log*

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Local experiments
tmp/
*.local.*
